{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 2025, the popular arcade game &quot;Demon Bride&quot; is back on Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fighting game depicting the battle between 17 angels and demons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy high-speed, deep battles with flashy bullets and powerful special moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, the rollback-compatible net code allows for smooth online battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Angels, demons, and humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The destinies of each are intricately intertwined, and Tokyo becomes the stage for the battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--The opening bell is the oath of the contract. In sealed-off Tokyo, the contract holders dance--</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3390980?t=1764299037","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3390980?t=1764299037","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390980/758d3f3849fb8a41768062dc2e21886ad8be8871/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764299037","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390980/758d3f3849fb8a41768062dc2e21886ad8be8871/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764299037","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 2025, the popular arc